{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_runtime_bun_bun", "label": "Bun (primaere Runtime)", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Zuerst getestet, Benchmarks laufen gegen Bun, die Docs nehmen Bun an. Vorteile: ~3-5x schnellerer Cold-Start, eingebautes bun:sqlite, eingebauter Test-Runner, natives Bun.serve, und weniger Peer-Deps (ersetzt ws und better-sqlite3). Benoetigt Bun 1.3+.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/runtime/bun.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_runtime_bun_bun_sqlite", "label": "bun:sqlite", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Eingebaut; SqliteJournal erkennt es automatisch, kein better-sqlite3-Install noetig.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/runtime/bun.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_runtime_bun_bun_test", "label": "bun:test", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Drop-in-kompatibel mit Jests API (describe/it/expect); TestKit funktioniert direkt.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/runtime/bun.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_runtime_bun_honobackend", "label": "HonoBackend", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Auf Bun die schlankeste HTTP-Option, weil es auf dem WHATWG-fetch-Adapter aufbaut, den Bun ohnehin anbietet, und zu einem winzigen Bundle tree-shaket. Fuer das breitere Node-Oekosystem (Fastify-Plugins, Middleware) bleibt Fastify der Default.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/runtime/bun.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_runtime_bun_performance", "label": "Performance auf Bun", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Grobe Zahlen auf einem M-Series-Mac: ~10 M tell/sec auf MicrotaskDispatcher, ~150 K req/sec fuer triviale HTTP-Routen, ~50 K SQLite-Events/sec, Start unter 100 ms gegen Nodes 300-500 ms.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/runtime/bun.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_runtime_bun_limitierungen", "label": "Bun-spezifische Limitierungen", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Bun strebt Node-Kompatibilitaet an, ist aber nicht bug-kompatibel: native Bindings gegen das Node-ABI und manche Streams-API-Edge-Cases brechen. AWS Lambda liefert Bun nicht als Runtime aus \u2014 fuer Serverless Node nehmen.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/runtime/bun.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_runtime_bun_bun", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_runtime_bun_bun_sqlite", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/runtime/bun.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_runtime_bun_bun", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_runtime_bun_bun_test", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/runtime/bun.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_runtime_bun_bun", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_runtime_bun_honobackend", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/runtime/bun.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_runtime_bun_bun", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_runtime_bun_performance", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/runtime/bun.mdx", "source_location": null, "